  "description": "A from-scratch, dependency-light PDF toolkit for .NET 8 / 9 / 10. Build, read, transform, secure, sign, redact, watermark, merge, split, fill forms, validate (PDF/A and PDF/UA), and convert HTML / Markdown / SVG / draw.io diagrams to PDF. v1.1 adds a fluent PdfBuilder, async services with CancellationToken, Stream overloads, unified PdfOperationResult, PageRangeParser, ILogger<T> diagnostics, services.AddVerica() DI registration, and a draw.io converter (raw/compressed .drawio, .drawio.svg, .png with embedded mxfile). OCR and Barcode modules removed in 1.1.",
  "id": "Verica",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-12T05:01:58.31Z",
